---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
---

<Layout 
  title="The 7 Time Epochs & Biomes Encyclopedia | Dino Run: Epochs" 
  description="Explore the rich lore, hazards, audio themes, and survival secrets of all 7 Epochs in Dino Run: Jurassic, Volcanic, Ice Age, Desert, Forest, Cyberpunk, and Cosmos Zero-G."
>
  <Header activePage="epochs" />

  <main class="content-page">
    <div class="section-container">
      <div class="content-hero">
        <span class="badge">Biomes & Lore Encyclopedia</span>
        <h1>The 7 Time <span class="gradient-text">Epochs</span></h1>
        <p>Journey through prehistoric jungles, apocalyptic firestorms, frozen glacial wastes, neon synthwave metropolises, and deep zero-g space.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="content-body">
        <div class="info-callout">
          <p><strong>Dynamic Era Progression:</strong> In Dino Run: Epochs, the world transitions continuously as your run progresses. Each epoch features tailored parallax backgrounds, unique particle weather effects, responsive obstacles, and adaptive music.</p>
        </div>

        <!-- Biome 1: Jurassic Dawn -->
        <div class="content-card biome-detail" id="jurassic">
          <div class="biome-header">
            <span class="biome-icon-large">🌴</span>
            <div>
              <h2>1. Jurassic Dawn (Prehistoric Wilderness)</h2>
              <span class="era-tag">Starting Era • Score: 0 – 3,500</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <p>
            <strong>The Setting:</strong> The primordial beginning of your odyssey. Towering Cycad trees, giant prehistoric ferns, and distant misty mountain ranges form the serene backdrop of an untouched Mesozoic Earth.
          </p>
          <h3>Environmental Hazards:</h3>
          <ul>
            <li><strong>Low-Flying Pterodactyls:</strong> Patrol the skies in rhythmic patterns. Requires ducking or jumping depending on altitude.</li>
            <li><strong>Primitive Boulders & Fern Roots:</strong> Clustered obstacles that teach foundational jump-timing and variable height control.</li>
          </ul>
          <h3>Soundtrack & Atmosphere:</h3>
          <p>Tropical percussion, tribal flutes, and distant primeval birds create an energetic, rhythmic tempo.</p>
          <div class="survival-tip">
            <strong>Survival Secret:</strong> Use this early era to collect every floating gold coin and get into your jump rhythm before speeds increase.
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Biome 2: Volcanic Wasteland -->
        <div class="content-card biome-detail" id="volcano">
          <div class="biome-header">
            <span class="biome-icon-large">🌋</span>
            <div>
              <h2>2. Volcanic Wasteland (The Great Eruption)</h2>
              <span class="era-tag">Era II • Score: 3,500 – 7,500</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <p>
            <strong>The Setting:</strong> The sky turns a menacing crimson as subterranean fissures erupt. Rivers of boiling magma flank the running path, with towering volcanoes belching pyroclastic smoke in the background.
          </p>
          <h3>Environmental Hazards:</h3>
          <ul>
            <li><strong>Equalizer Lava Spouts:</strong> Boiling magma geysers that erupt rhythmically in sync with the heavy bass soundtrack.</li>
            <li><strong>Falling Fire Meteorites:</strong> Flaming projectiles that drop diagonally across the screen, demanding quick horizontal decision-making.</li>
          </ul>
          <h3>Soundtrack & Atmosphere:</h3>
          <p>Aggressive industrial drum beats, deep bass rumbles, and the crackle of burning embers.</p>
          <div class="survival-tip">
            <strong>Survival Secret:</strong> Look for the glowing ground sparks that appear 0.5 seconds before a lava spout erupts to prepare a full-height leap.
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Biome 3: Ice Age Glaciers -->
        <div class="content-card biome-detail" id="ice">
          <div class="biome-header">
            <span class="biome-icon-large">❄️</span>
            <div>
              <h2>3. Ice Age Glaciers (Sub-Zero Frost)</h2>
              <span class="era-tag">Era III • Score: 7,500 – 12,500</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <p>
            <strong>The Setting:</strong> A sudden temperature plunge encases the world in frozen crystalline ice. The sky illuminates with glowing emerald Northern Lights (Aurora Borealis) as snow flurries sweep past.
          </p>
          <h3>Environmental Hazards:</h3>
          <ul>
            <li><strong>Frost Spikes & Stalagmites:</strong> Sharp, brittle ice formations that require precise clearance.</li>
            <li><strong>Snowdrift Obstacles:</strong> Dense snowdrifts that test low-altitude obstacle timing.</li>
          </ul>
          <h3>Soundtrack & Atmosphere:</h3>
          <p>Ethereal synth bells, sweeping wind chimes, and a crisp, crystalline acoustic atmosphere.</p>
          <div class="survival-tip">
            <strong>Survival Secret:</strong> Don't get mesmerized by the glowing Aurora Borealis in the sky—keep your focus locked on the fast-approaching ice spikes!
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Biome 4: Sandstone Desert -->
        <div class="content-card biome-detail" id="desert">
          <div class="biome-header">
            <span class="biome-icon-large">🏜️</span>
            <div>
              <h2>4. Sandstone Desert (The Golden Sands)</h2>
              <span class="era-tag">Era IV • Score: 12,500 – 18,000</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <p>
            <strong>The Setting:</strong> Vast shimmering golden dunes beneath a blazing sun. Ancient Egyptian pyramids and enigmatic stone obelisks rise majestically on the horizon through shimmering heat hazes.
          </p>
          <h3>Environmental Hazards:</h3>
          <ul>
            <li><strong>Rolling Tumbleweeds:</strong> Dynamic, moving obstacles that roll toward you faster than static ground obstacles.</li>
            <li><strong>Giant Desert Cacti & Sandstone Crags:</strong> Tall multi-tier obstacles that necessitate maximum-height jumps.</li>
          </ul>
          <h3>Soundtrack & Atmosphere:</h3>
          <p>Middle Eastern string melodies, hypnotic percussion, and ambient desert wind sweeps.</p>
          <div class="survival-tip">
            <strong>Survival Secret:</strong> Jump slightly earlier for rolling tumbleweeds than for static cactus spikes to compensate for their relative velocity.
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Biome 5: Enchanted Forest -->
        <div class="content-card biome-detail" id="forest">
          <div class="biome-header">
            <span class="biome-icon-large">🌲</span>
            <div>
              <h2>5. Enchanted Spore Forest (Bioluminescent Realm)</h2>
              <span class="era-tag">Era V • Score: 18,000 – 25,000</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <p>
            <strong>The Setting:</strong> A mystical ancient woodland shrouded in twilight mist. Towering giant mushrooms, glowing fungal caps, and shimmering bioluminescent spores fill the enchanted air.
          </p>
          <h3>Environmental Hazards:</h3>
          <ul>
            <li><strong>Giant Spore Mushrooms:</strong> Wide obstacles that require sustained hold-jumps to clear safely.</li>
            <li><strong>Swarming Fireflies & Flying Hazards:</strong> Dense airborne clusters that restrict jumping heights and force strategic ducking.</li>
          </ul>
          <h3>Soundtrack & Atmosphere:</h3>
          <p>Mystical glockenspiels, ambient arpeggiators, and soft, magical woodwind harmonies.</p>
          <div class="survival-tip">
            <strong>Survival Secret:</strong> When the Magnetic Dynamo powerup spawns here, grab it immediately to safely hoover up the massive coin clusters hidden among the mushroom caps.
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Biome 6: Cyberpunk Metropolis -->
        <div class="content-card biome-detail" id="cyberpunk">
          <div class="biome-header">
            <span class="biome-icon-large">🏙️</span>
            <div>
              <h2>6. Cyberpunk Metropolis (Synthwave Future)</h2>
              <span class="era-tag">Era VI • Score: 25,000 – 35,000</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <p>
            <strong>The Setting:</strong> The dino is hurled into a dystopian futuristic megacity. Towering neon skyscrapers, holographic Japanese kanji billboards, flying hover-cars, and digital glitch scanlines dominate the visual spectacle.
          </p>
          <h3>Environmental Hazards:</h3>
          <ul>
            <li><strong>Neon Laser Barriers:</strong> Pulsing electronic barriers with rhythmic on/off timing.</li>
            <li><strong>Digital Glitch Surges:</strong> Holographic obstacles that flicker and surge at high velocity.</li>
          </ul>
          <h3>Soundtrack & Atmosphere:</h3>
          <p>Pumping 128 BPM retro synthwave, crunchy analog sawtooth synths, and neon cyberpunk basslines.</p>
          <div class="survival-tip">
            <strong>Survival Secret:</strong> The game speed is intense here! Rely heavily on the Duck/Fast-Fall mechanic to quickly reset your jump arcs between rapid-fire obstacle clusters.
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Biome 7: Cosmos Zero-G -->
        <div class="content-card biome-detail" id="cosmos">
          <div class="biome-header">
            <span class="biome-icon-large">🚀</span>
            <div>
              <h2>7. Cosmos Zero-G (The Cosmic Frontier)</h2>
              <span class="era-tag">Final Era • Score: 35,000+</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <p>
            <strong>The Setting:</strong> The ultimate frontier. Escaping planetary gravity, our dinosaur runs across stellar asteroid bridges against a majestic backdrop of spinning galaxies, planetary rings, and shooting starfields.
          </p>
          <h3>Environmental Hazards:</h3>
          <ul>
            <li><strong>Cosmic Asteroid Showers:</strong> Dense showers of meteors falling from the upper stratosphere.</li>
            <li><strong>Orbital Space Debris:</strong> Floating satellite fragments and solar panels.</li>
            <li><strong>Zero-Gravity Physics:</strong> Jumps float longer and drift higher, radically altering the game's timing muscle memory!</li>
          </ul>
          <h3>Soundtrack & Atmosphere:</h3>
          <p>Grand orchestral space synth, sweeping cinematic pads, and celestial arpeggios.</p>
          <div class="survival-tip">
            <strong>Survival Secret:</strong> Because zero-g extends your hang-time in the air, tap the jump button very lightly. Over-jumping will leave you floating helplessly into high-altitude asteroid debris!
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="info-callout">
          <p>Think you have what it takes to survive all 7 Epochs and blast into deep space? <a href="/#play" style="color: var(--accent-cyan); font-weight: 700;">Start your run now</a> and set a world record!</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>

  <Footer />
</Layout>

<style>
  .biome-detail {
    margin: 40px 0;
    transition: transform 0.3s ease, border-color 0.3s ease;
  }

  .biome-detail:hover {
    border-color: var(--accent-cyan);
    box-shadow: 0 16px 40px rgba(0, 229, 255, 0.1);
  }

  .biome-header {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 20px;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
    padding-bottom: 16px;
  }

  .biome-icon-large {
    font-size: 48px;
    line-height: 1;
  }

  .biome-header h2 {
    font-size: 24px;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: #FFFFFF;
    margin: 0 0 6px 0;
    border-bottom: none;
    padding-bottom: 0;
  }

  .era-tag {
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--accent-cyan);
    background: rgba(0, 229, 255, 0.1);
    padding: 3px 10px;
    border-radius: 12px;
    display: inline-block;
  }

  .survival-tip {
    background: rgba(255, 213, 79, 0.08);
    border-left: 4px solid var(--accent-gold);
    padding: 14px 18px;
    border-radius: 0 var(--radius-sm) var(--radius-sm) 0;
    color: #FEF08A;
    font-size: 15px;
    margin-top: 16px;
  }

  .survival-tip strong {
    color: var(--accent-gold);
  }
</style>
